sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to reboot the Charging Station with type OnIdle

    CSMS->>CS: ResetRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: ResetResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Steps 5 and 6: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of all connectors

    loop For each connector
        alt State reported with StatusNotificationRequest
            CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
            CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
        else State reported with NotifyEventRequest
            CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
            CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        end
    end
